
---

### 📄 `.gitignore` (for Navigoals)

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Virtual environments
venv/
ENV/
env/
.venv

# Environment variables (SECRETS – never commit)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Database files (SQLite)
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Logs
*.log

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Project specific
*.tmp
*.temp